Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.07,0:01:32.91,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(729,0)\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}Battle of Monsters on Onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King of the pirates? Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did his attack look on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new Haki must be the technique\Nthat the old man taught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His punches can hurt kaido,\Nbut there's gotta be a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might just win this—that's nice\Nand all—but before I do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something I gotta\Nget straight with Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shrimp, you don't even know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even know What it means to be King of the\NPirates is not something you take lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop running your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He kicked his ass in Curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he get so much stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Few can stand up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they are not to be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you didn't come here just to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you think\Nyou're as good as them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw that one coming,\Nbut he's fast! Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an improvement over\Nlast time, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, practice\Nmeant to be incinerated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll burn you to ash, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair badly! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxfire style!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flameran!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got Prometheus right in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:03:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Kittymon's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-oh-oh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lower your guard, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with two emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, because there's something\Nyou and I need to get straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those samurai—I was gonna teleport them to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,safety anyway—before you\Nsaid a damn word to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you just had to bark orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know how that made me look?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking orders from you\Nlike a damn subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn subordinate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone care about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the idea, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You followed Straw Hat's orders\Nto show your loyalty to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a loser with a loser underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the loser, you big stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that directed at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can squabble on\Nyour own damn time. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just for me, the astronaut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Baba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the deal! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first person who\Ndodges her attack, loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would agree to that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a Gates man and you're\Nstill pulling this nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:06:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes\Nto make it with real pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're blinded!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're losers and I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourselves. I'm not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're not playing, then\Nwhy are you still standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wusses! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you all just stand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for being King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the fun part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna kill you rotten rats? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec, Linlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see how strong\Nthese kids are, hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that seems like a waste\Nof time, you stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took Kaido, huh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:07:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that mask fooled me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd know that laugh anywhere\Nif I had these punishers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we fought, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro Giri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beheading Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three swords die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to unleash a little\Nmore of your power, Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna finish you in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the Feltzman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Ruo, and Tapas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each of you a monster in your own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you have what it\Ntakes to be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that stung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably couldn't break\Nyour next skin if I tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean I can't crush\Nyou to death with enough pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to see me at my worst, I'm\Nhappy to get you a front row seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not bad, but it needs\Nmore mass to seal the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try this, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Now, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were gonna take me\Nout too, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really trying to bury me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reminds me of the good old day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All charged and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I thought you were all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't half bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're crazy enough to\Naim for King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the least I can expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, none of you have\Nany hope of stopping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come this far, but you'll\Nall be dead in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll take so much\Nmore than just your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like any good pirate, I'll take all\Nyour crew members who followed you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just your crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take all of your treasures, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some poneglyphs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fair prize for what you put me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't think about treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to take yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins this battle will be one step\Ncloser to becoming king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right about\Nthat and it's gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DEMOLITION DUST.
