Dialogue: 13,0:15:52.22,0:15:54.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\fnArtificeSSK\fscx200\fscy200\pos(1219,915)\bord0\blur0.8\c&H212020&}Gust
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just scraps anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots will never\Nbe king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least you can\Nentertain me before you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land of Wano is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will bring a new era!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you carry the weight for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you deliver this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it belong to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kong, Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kong, rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it a nap, Mr. Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this is your wake of call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen an anatomical\Nchart of a dragon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your heart should be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't beat you from the\Noutside, I'll do it from within!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite the pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See if you've done your research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know how durable I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not as stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those scales of yours are\Na real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know a trick to get inside too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scyther!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one hurt, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're under the\Nopen sky, you're my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't think you could\Nescape from me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit, my expectations weren't\Nexactly high, but this has been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know! Rhino Schneider!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport me up there and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a moving service, and\NI don't take orders from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it because I want to,\Nnot because you told me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxfire style!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glass bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flame red!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like you're my boss, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no ordinary weapon he's got!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood! Dragon! Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this power I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.26,0:22:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is Odin's presence in his sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you get\Nfor taking us lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.06,0:22:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indra!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All lined up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's wrath, God of\NLightning! Heed my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is a living calamity!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you survive all that\Nlightning without a scratch on you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tush!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a robber man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for hurting my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire doesn't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.32,0:24:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause God!
